  "title": "스레나 입문자들을 위한 덱구성 탬플릿",
  "body": "에밀리아, 웡 미사용3주년유입이라 없어서 못써봄일단 내가 해본 덱들만 넣어둔거라 더 좋은 구성이 있을 수 있고본인의 덱풀에 맞춰 다른 공략글과 비교해가며 가능한 덱을 짜보자",
  "bodyHtml": "<p><br></p>\n            <p></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg4.dcinside.co.kr/viewimage.php?no=29bcc427b69d39b37ab0ccaf17dd6b6f62b51891c5c2132f1e5fd4c39dbc36c4e5309ddb30a46a54fbd5586ec5c178b368e97dcf2a059e607ba118a2c4b7eb7cdfb6bc7db0a10baf56\" id=\"auto_zzal_img\" alt=\"7be58871b4836cfe38e7e9e64f892569822ae42dc5ab2c9a36c4866e8e6a2ebbc47e1bce511c776d50e49ebf40ca0fd05c733033186b6dd5aaf6e4\" data-azno=\"auto_zzal_660344\"></p>\n                <p><br></p><p></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">에밀리아, 웡 미사용</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">3주년유입이라 없어서 못써봄</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg4.dcinside.co.kr/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce787fa1bd625314b5d207020df860bbe98c96dc2c178c8f973d560460c4044674e983dee76fc56a385595db539d686d23a7d493b06d1\" data-fileno=\"4167111\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef046b6a67953724\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg4.dcinside.co.kr/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce787fa1bd625314b5d207020df860bbe98c96dc2c178c8f973d560460c4044664c9c35e572f450f854510ee31dd78c7dbac023c872e6\" data-fileno=\"4167112\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef0468e5afe2bd62\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg4.dcinside.co.kr/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce787fa1bd625314b5d207020df860bbe98c96dc2c178c8f973d560460c4044684d9f3ae076f35e42a57cd5f60d7bab1d094494ea3cff\" data-fileno=\"4167113\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef0468e3ace3bf63\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg4.dcinside.co.kr/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce787fa1bd625314b5d207020df860bbe98c96dc2c178c8f973d560460c4044674a9a35e675f3579162623b16b04bc95b325cc831daad\" data-fileno=\"4167114\" alt=\"24b0d121e09c28a8699fe8b115ef0469963ff5bef5\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://dcimg4.dcinside.co.kr/viewimage.php?id=2ab2c6&amp;no=24b0d769e1d32ca73ce787fa1bd625314b5d207020df860bbe98c96dc2c178c8f973d560460c404468459c39e572f05003b2136e8ddafc8